Carve-out: quoted fragments of Polish normative acts are excluded from copyright under
art. 4 of the Polish Copyright Act (ustawa z dnia 4 lutego 1994 r. o prawie autorskim
i prawach pokrewnych) and are in the public domain; the CC BY 4.0 license applies to
the compilation, questions, and metadata, not to those fragments.

Attribution requirement: cite this repository and state the source of the underlying
legal texts — Internetowy System Aktów Prawnych (ISAP), Kancelaria Sejmu RP
(https://isap.sejm.gov.pl) and the Sejm ELI API (https://api.sejm.gov.pl).

